message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mbsolver: Fast Maxwell-Bloch solvers for masers, superradiance and coherent pulse propagation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anari
    given-names: Vahid
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2464-3989"
  - family-names: Rashidi
    given-names: Toktam
