version: 0.6.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23407483
repository-code: "https://github.com/vahid-anari/mbsolver"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/mbsolver/"
abstract: >-
  Fast Maxwell-Bloch solvers in Python (numpy + numba) for astrophysical
  masers, superradiance and coherent pulse propagation: one-dimensional
  two-level and Lambda-type three-level models with pump and boundary-field
  profiles, relaxation-time schedules, and the scaling from physical sample
  values to the solvers' dimensionless parameters.
keywords:
  - Maxwell-Bloch equations
  - masers
  - superradiance
  - astrophysics
  - numerical simulation
